              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalolosuku kwamiswa abantu bokuphatha izindlu zokulondoloza iziphiwo lezithelo zokuqala lokwetshumi, lokuqoqa izabelo zabapristi lezamaLevi ezimiswe ngumlayo ngamasimu emizi. Bonke abakoJuda babethokoza kakhulu ngokukhonza kwabapristi lamaLevi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
