          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensukwini zikaZerubabeli loNehemiya bonke abakoIsrayeli banika isabelo sensuku zonke esabahlabeleli lesabalindi bamasango; bahlukanisela amaLevi lokho okungokwawo, lamaLevi ahlukanisela abakoAroni lokho okungokwabo.",
